Chapter: PunctualFastMath
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Punctual chapter FastMath

 We say:

Section: Entry
  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 1: " & show (int-log2 1))
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 256: " & show (int-log2 256))
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 1023: " & show (int-log2 1023))
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 0: " & show (int-log2 0))
  end
